   "texts": {
    "LavaridgeTown_Text_HotSpringsNeverRunDry": "We draw as much hot water as we need,\\nand yet the hot springs never run dry.\\pIsn't it magical?\\pThese hot springs appear near active\\nvolcanoes. Veins of water under the\\lground are heated by magma to well up\\las hot springs.$"
