   "texts": {
    "LavaridgeTown_Text_HaveEggWillYouTakeIt": "I have here an EGG.\\pI'd hoped to hatch it by covering it in\\nhot sand by the hot springs.\\lBut that doesn't seem to be enough...\\pI've heard it would be best if it were\\nkept together with POKéMON and\\lcarried about.\\pYou are a TRAINER, yes?\\nAnd your POKéMON radiate vitality.\\pSo, what say you?\\nWill you take this EGG to hatch?$",
    "LavaridgeTown_Text_HopeYoullWalkPlentyWithEgg": "Good! I hope you'll walk plenty with\\nthis here EGG!$",
